      Docita is operated by <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">CHANDALURI VAMSI KRISHNA</strong>, a registered sole proprietorship in India.
    </p>
    <p>GSTIN: 36CJPPC6222C1ZI</p>
    <p>Aparna Cyberscape, Nalagandla, Hyderabad, Telangana 500019</p>
  </div>
</footer>
